  "description": "I was sentenced to death and died.\n\n“To kill you as a villain would be a bit of a waste. How about it? I want to give you a chance.”\n\nNo, I thought I was dead. But was it because of what the enemy-like guy said just before I died?\n\n‘Geren, that son of a bitch…!’\n\nWhen I opened my eyes, it was ten years ago. And in a different world! Since I’ve come back to life, there’s nothing I can do. To avoid repeating the foolish past, I used that enemy-like guy as my wallet.\n\n“Give me everything from here to there.”  \n\n“You’re going to buy all of this?”\n\n“Well, I heard from my friends that my dear granddaughter likes shopping so much, and that you act cute, too.”  \n\n“It’s just because I need a wallet.  \n\nEven the once-broken family relationship was splendidly restored. The business of love, which I had once already given up on, had also started perfectly.\n\nIt was the perfect future I had hoped for… even to someone like me who thought I was incompetent, power awakened within me.  \n\n**[Original Novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/62730241/)**\n\n**Original Webtoon**  \n[Kakaopage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69760545/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%A7%9D%EB%82%98%EB%8B%88-%EC%95%85%EB%85%80%EA%B0%80-%EB%8F%8C%EC%95%84%EC%99%94%EB%8B%A4/4912)",
